 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "大多数事故不是新漏洞，而是旧漏洞在新环境里复发。",
   "spoken": "大多数事故不是新漏洞，而是旧漏洞在新环境里复发。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.196,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 4.294,
   "speechEnd": 8.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "新环境可以是一条新链，一个分叉，一个新版本，或者一种新的组合方式。",
   "spoken": "新环境可以是一条新链，一个分岔，一个新版本，或者一种新的组合方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.008,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 10.106,
   "speechEnd": 15.832
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方，航空业把每一起事故，都写成公开报告。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，航空业把每一起事故，都写成公开报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.9,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 16.998,
   "speechEnd": 20.998
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "所以今天的飞行员，不会再犯 1970 年代的错误。",
   "spoken": "所以今天的飞行员，不会再犯 1970 年代的错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.064,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 22.162,
   "speechEnd": 26.102
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "链上安全也有自己的事故报告，项目复盘，安全公司分析，还有链上数据。",
   "spoken": "链上安全也有自己的事故报告，项目复盘，安全公司分析，还有链上数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.156,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 27.254,
   "speechEnd": 33.289
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "读事故报告，是成本最低的安全训练。",
   "spoken": "读事故报告，是成本最低的安全训练。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.36,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 34.458,
   "speechEnd": 37.077
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.132,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 38.23,
   "speechEnd": 40.015
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "航空事故由独立机构调查，结论有权威性。",
   "spoken": "航空事故由独立机构掉查，结论有权威性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.064,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 41.162,
   "speechEnd": 44.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "链上事故的复盘，多数由项目方或安全公司发布。",
   "spoken": "链上事故的复盘，多数由项目方或安全公司发布。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.94,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 46.038,
   "speechEnd": 49.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "细节可能不完整，归因也可能有争议。",
   "spoken": "细节可能不完整，归因也可能有争议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.6,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 50.698,
   "speechEnd": 53.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "所以读复盘时，只采信多方公开资料一致的事实。",
   "spoken": "所以读复盘时，只采信多方公开资料一致的事实。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.42,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 54.518,
   "speechEnd": 58.375
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "在这座档案馆里，每一起事故按两个标签归档，根因类别和链。",
   "spoken": "在这座档案馆里，每一起事故按两个标签归档，根因类别和链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.44,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 59.538,
   "speechEnd": 64.407
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "以太坊和多链，BNB Chain，TRON，Mantle，各有一面展墙。",
   "spoken": "以太坊和多链，BNB Chain，TRON，Mantle，各有一面展墙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 65.468,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 65.566,
   "speechEnd": 70.387
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "还有两面，一面放代码之外的事故，一面放 NFT 与 GameFi。",
   "spoken": "还有两面，一面放代码之外的事故，一面放 NFT 与 GameFi。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.424,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 71.522,
   "speechEnd": 75.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "金额都是事发时的美元估值，只能看作约数。",
   "spoken": "金额都是事发时的美元估值，只能看作约数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 76.828,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 76.926,
   "speechEnd": 80.009
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "没有摆上展墙的，不代表没有发生。",
   "spoken": "没有摆上展墙的，不代表没有发生。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 81.08,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 81.178,
   "speechEnd": 83.773
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "六十多起事故摆在一起，反复出现的，其实只有八种模式。",
   "spoken": "六十多起事故摆在一起，反复出现的，其实只有八种模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 84.828,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 84.926,
   "speechEnd": 89.318
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "前五种藏在代码和版本里，后三种，出在签名、密钥和人身上。",
   "spoken": "前五种藏在代码和版本里，后三种，出在签名、密钥和人身上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
