   "id": "c33"
  },
  {
   "text": "各有一面展墙",
   "start": 69.373,
   "end": 70.507,
   "id": "c34"
  },
  {
   "text": "还有两面",
   "start": 71.472,
   "end": 72.32,
   "id": "c35"
  },
  {
   "text": "一面放代码之外的事故",
   "start": 72.495,
   "end": 73.975,
   "id": "c36"
  },
  {
   "text": "一面放 NFT 与 GameFi",
